  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed crossover would result in vehicles reversing from or into the classified road leading to vehicles stopping, slowing and turning from or into Bury Street West thus adversely affecting highway safety and prejudicial to the free flow of traffic on the classified road to the detriment of the road safety and free flow of traffic, including pedestrians and public transport, and to the detriment of publicly available kerbside parking where alternative means of access to the rear can be made available.  As such, the proposal would be contrary to the Council's Technical Footway Guidance 2013, Policy DMD 45 and DMD46 of the Development Management Document, and the Core Strategy policies 24 and 30, as well as the aims of the NPPF.\r\r"
